WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.540
Devine : Box internet ou Lave-linge ?

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.840
Lequel coûte le plus cher par an ?

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.920
Tu as trois secondes.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:07.460
Trois.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:08.080
